# Systems of record

| System | Role | Agent behavior |
|--------|------|----------------|
| **Jira** | Work | Source of truth for tickets (`KAN-*`). Fetch acceptance criteria via Atlassian MCP before coding. Update status/comments when starting/finishing; never invent ticket scope. |
| **GitHub** | Implementation | Branches, PRs, reviews, CI, deploy triggers. Code and deploy history live here. Link PRs to Jira keys. |
| **GitBook / Markdown** | Knowledge | Durable how/why (architecture, runbooks, product). Prefer updating/creating markdown over burying facts only in chat or Jira. No GitBook MCP — use repo markdown. |
| **MCP / API** | Agent interface | Prefer MCP (Jira, GitHub, browser, etc.) over guessing or scraping. If MCP is missing/auth-failed, stop and ask — do not invent data. |

```
Jira (work) → Agent via MCP → GitHub (implementation)
                            → Docs (GitBook / Markdown)
GitHub → Deploy triggers
```
